  "id": "tequila-lime-grilled-shrimp",
  "name": "Tequila-Lime Grilled Shrimp",
  "subtitle": "Cilantro-lime shrimp with a light tequila kick",
  "description": "Shrimp marinated with lime, cilantro, garlic, and spices, then threaded onto skewers and grilled until opaque and fully cooked.",
